// ---------- H-36-only mechanisms ----------
// R36 repair probe: H-PAM-36 commit-then-sample with fresh-seed discipline.
// GENERATED by gen_r36.py — do not hand-edit.
// Substituted placeholders: PREREG_SHA, M36A_SEED_HI, M36A_SEED_LO,
// M36A_TRIALS, M36A_IDBASE (values asserted from rt_jklm/drive36.zag).
// Pure Zag, zero RNG. Seed = ns_sha256(harness-committed transcript);
// seed-reuse detector refuses loudly on a repeated seed (ledger via argv).

